                            <div class="si-testimonial-box">
                                <div class="si-testimonial-text">
                                    <h2>“Ovanta team quickly understood our requirements <br class="d-none d-xxl-block"> and were proactive and flexible with support and a <br class="d-none d-xxl-block"> ongoin  complex developments. You  definitely trust <br class="d-none d-xxl-block"> them for complex project requirements as they are <br class="d-none d-xxl-block"> top-notch in their field and recommend it.”</h2>
